    {
      "id": "passage:01",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "这是完全原创的结构测试故事，与原神剧情无关。",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/0",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:02",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "我是木匠青禾。",
      "speaker_id": "person:carpenter",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/1",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:03",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "阿砚是我的徒弟。",
      "speaker_id": "person:carpenter",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/2",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:04",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "我跟随木匠青禾学习木工，已经三年。",
      "speaker_id": "person:student",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/3",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:05",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "小队准备修复村外的桥。",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/4",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:06",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "阿砚，我们一起修桥。",
      "speaker_id": "person:helper",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/5",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:07"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:07",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "好，阿宁，我们共同负责桥面。",
      "speaker_id": "person:student",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/6",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:08"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:08",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "我有一个孩子，名字写在封存的名册里。",
      "speaker_id": "person:carpenter",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/7",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:09"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:09",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "我也叫青禾，我是路过的商人，不是那位木匠。",
      "speaker_id": "person:merchant",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/8",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:10",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "小队将选择东路或西路，两条路线互斥。",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/9",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:11",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "先核对物资。",
      "speaker_id": "person:student",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/10",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:12",
        "passage:13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:12",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "走东路。",
      "speaker_id": "person:student",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/11",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:13",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "走西路。",
      "speaker_id": "person:student",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/12",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:18"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:14",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "商人青禾扣留了我们的木材，我要阻止他。",
      "speaker_id": "person:student",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/13",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening",
        "east"
      ],
      "branch_id": "east",
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:15",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "今天我不会把木材交给你。",
      "speaker_id": "person:merchant",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/14",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening",
        "east"
      ],
      "branch_id": "east",
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:16",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "东路队伍另行寻找材料。",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/15",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening",
        "east"
      ],
      "branch_id": "east",
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:17",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "东路记录到此结束。",
      "speaker_id": "person:student",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/16",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening",
        "east"
      ],
      "branch_id": "east",
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:18",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "商人青禾，我们合作运输这些木材。",
      "speaker_id": "person:student",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/17",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening",
        "west"
      ],
      "branch_id": "west",
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:19",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "成交，我负责马车，你负责清点。",
      "speaker_id": "person:merchant",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/18",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening",
        "west"
      ],
      "branch_id": "west",
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:20",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "西路队伍完成运输。",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/19",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening",
        "west"
      ],
      "branch_id": "west",
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:21",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "先核对物资。",
      "speaker_id": "person:student",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/20",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening",
        "west"
      ],
      "branch_id": "west",
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:22",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "无论选择哪条路，接下来的记录只描述修桥工作。",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/21",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:23",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "桥面已经修好。",
      "speaker_id": "person:helper",
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/22",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:31"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "passage:24",
      "snapshot_id": "fixture-2026-10-10-v1",
      "entry_id": "entry:bridge",
      "text": "当前阶段的公开记录结束。",
      "speaker_id": null,
      "source_id": "source:fixture",
      "source_locator": "data/samples/story.json#/passages/23",
      "required_scope_ids": [
        "opening"
      ],
      "branch_id": null,
      "next_ids": [
        "passage:25"
      ]
    },
